# Helion project for the ZedBoard blinky (xc7z020clg484-1).
#
# Reproducible build (run from the repo root of the merged bring-up branch):
#   cargo test -p helion-xilinx7 --test zedboard_e2e
# The end-to-end driver test above runs:
#   synth examples/zedboard_blinky.sv
#   -> read_xdc examples/zedboard.xdc (PACKAGE_PIN / IOSTANDARD / create_clock)
#   -> pack / place / route for xc7z020
#   -> FASM -> frames -> zedboard_blinky.bit
#
# Requires the xc7z020 X-Ray database at ~/workspace/xilinx-dbsrc (or set
# HELION_XILINX_DB), wired up by the device-db worker on branch
# fm/zedboard-db.
part xc7z020
read_sv examples/zedboard_blinky.sv
read_xdc examples/zedboard.xdc
top zedboard_blinky
